flowchart TB
  Paper[Paper title + abstract]
  Paper --> Mode{extract mode}
  Mode -->|heuristic| H[Sentence regex triggers]
  Mode -->|llm| L[gpt-4o-mini JSON extract]
  Mode -->|auto| A{API key?}
  A -->|yes| L
  A -->|no| H
  H --> Claim[Claim + quote_span]
  L --> Claim
  Paper --> Ev[Evidence + quote_span]
  Claim --> Align[gap score Jaccard + TF-cosine]
  Ev --> Align
  Align --> Gap[Gap multi-axis scores]
  Gap --> Topics[3-5 Topic proposals]
